From a2a8bb386dc5e36dca448648bb90cc1dac301cf5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: C4risrocks <C4risrocks@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:21:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix: bound the Metal texture and surface caches

PICA textures keep at most 256 entries and 64 MiB of texels; the least recently bound go first. Surfaces keep at most 64 entries, trimmed least recently used after each draw and transfer. Bindings and in-flight draws keep their own Metal references, and a dropped surface reloads from guest memory on its next use.
